WEBVTT

00:23.600 --> 00:26.150
Privius Clock Tower.

00:26.150 --> 00:28.330
If we stop it, we win, right?

00:28.760 --> 00:31.640
Yeah, it'll be a piece of cake for us.

00:35.840 --> 00:37.090
Wind?

00:38.850 --> 00:40.560
<i>No. This is...</i>

00:42.170 --> 00:43.270
<i>Ice Wall!</i>

00:54.300 --> 00:55.700
What was that?

00:56.600 --> 00:57.640
An enemy.

01:01.790 --> 01:04.860
<i>The detection and the attack 
were almost simultaneous.</i>

01:06.920 --> 01:09.440
<i>The only one who'd be coming 
at us right now would be...</i>

01:12.100 --> 01:13.740
<i>Desir Herrman.</i>

01:18.070 --> 01:20.100
<i>Two participants have been disqualified.</i>

01:23.370 --> 01:24.990
<i>Fifteen people left.</i>

01:41.830 --> 01:49.000
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

01:51.370 --> 01:58.150
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

01:58.150 --> 02:00.720
<i>A stolen smile</i>

02:00.720 --> 02:10.100
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

02:10.100 --> 02:14.730
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

02:14.730 --> 02:19.150
<i>For the final challenge</i>

02:19.150 --> 02:22.580
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

02:22.580 --> 02:28.780
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

02:28.780 --> 02:32.120
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

02:32.120 --> 02:39.170
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

02:39.170 --> 02:41.500
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

02:41.500 --> 02:44.140
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

02:44.140 --> 02:48.980
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

02:48.980 --> 02:51.310
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

02:51.310 --> 02:53.940
<i>To my own story</i>

02:58.280 --> 03:02.790
<b></b>Episode Eight

02:58.280 --> 03:02.790
<b> Crash</b>

03:10.090 --> 03:11.050
On your right!

03:15.870 --> 03:17.760
There'll be more. They're coming in waves.

03:27.610 --> 03:29.110
Are you all right?

03:29.550 --> 03:30.560
Yes.

03:33.400 --> 03:35.740
Sorry, they blocked it.

03:35.740 --> 03:37.820
Well, Azest is on their team.

03:37.820 --> 03:39.070
That's to be expected.

03:40.660 --> 03:43.770
Our location is completely blown.

03:43.770 --> 03:45.620
That's fine.

03:46.540 --> 03:48.720
Let's set one up on another party.

03:50.980 --> 03:52.660
Are you insane?

03:53.300 --> 03:56.320
If we do that, all of them 
will gather here.

04:01.980 --> 04:04.270
Stop smiling and say something!

04:04.650 --> 04:06.600
Gathering them here is the point.

04:06.600 --> 04:07.760
What?

04:10.040 --> 04:12.400
Trust me, Romantica.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.590
Okay.

04:31.450 --> 04:33.630
<i>Two participants have been disqualified.</i>

04:34.670 --> 04:37.510
<i>There are 13 participants remaining.</i>

05:02.970 --> 05:04.110
Azest.

05:07.170 --> 05:08.210
I'm opening the door.

05:09.050 --> 05:10.210
Okay.

05:23.090 --> 05:24.860
Blue Moon, huh?

05:26.810 --> 05:29.480
Gabriel? You're here, too?

05:29.480 --> 05:32.250
Were you the ones who attacked us outside?

05:32.250 --> 05:33.180
What?

05:34.060 --> 05:37.210
A sneak attack using poor visibility...

05:37.210 --> 05:40.920
What a dirty trick for the 
top party in the academy.

05:40.920 --> 05:43.120
Our party was attacked, as well.

05:43.500 --> 05:45.920
No, that's a misunderstanding!

05:45.920 --> 05:48.810
Ha! You're going to play dumb?

05:50.190 --> 05:52.620
What proof do you have that it was us?

05:53.290 --> 05:58.180
There's no one who can use so many spells 
of that level at once except you guys.

05:59.990 --> 06:01.100
I see.

06:02.930 --> 06:06.580
<i>They'd never believe me if I told them 
that it was a beta's doing.</i>

06:07.530 --> 06:09.450
<i>So that's what he's after.</i>

06:10.830 --> 06:12.890
I'll take that as an affirmation.

06:14.380 --> 06:15.960
You two, do not engage.

06:20.360 --> 06:23.570
I will take care of them.

06:27.050 --> 06:33.330
You sure have a talent for 
annoying me, Azest Kingscrown.

06:34.380 --> 06:36.670
Spearburn!

06:40.780 --> 06:41.940
How do you like that?

06:41.940 --> 06:45.390
Our leader is the strongest 
flame mage!

06:45.640 --> 06:47.140
Idiot, next to you!

06:52.370 --> 06:53.310
Ice Wall!

06:59.170 --> 07:00.490
Damn it!

07:04.630 --> 07:06.550
You guys give me a hand, too!

07:07.580 --> 07:11.000
We won't be single rankers 
unless we beat them!

07:12.990 --> 07:14.630
Bring it on!

07:15.250 --> 07:18.510
Don't underestimate Pine Tree!

07:21.910 --> 07:23.260
Here they come!

07:58.350 --> 08:00.220
Sounds like it's over.

08:00.780 --> 08:01.780
Yes.

08:02.940 --> 08:04.380
It didn't work.

08:04.750 --> 08:05.760
What?

08:08.630 --> 08:10.330
There's no announcement.

09:04.120 --> 09:07.490
Too bad, Desir Herrman.

09:08.310 --> 09:10.190
As expected of you, Azest.

09:11.160 --> 09:13.870
I was hoping for friendly fire 
amongst the alphas...

09:15.700 --> 09:19.370
I just locked them in place. 
I didn't make them transport out.

09:23.790 --> 09:26.450
Our best bet would have been 
if you'd crushed each other,

09:26.880 --> 09:29.380
but you ruined that plan.

09:32.020 --> 09:33.830
What a pitiful plan.

09:49.030 --> 09:53.330
If you think you are qualified 
to call yourselves single rankers,

09:53.810 --> 09:55.720
fight me and prove it!

09:57.480 --> 09:58.450
Crap!

09:59.520 --> 10:00.410
Desir!

10:00.660 --> 10:01.950
Desir!

10:07.360 --> 10:09.310
Pay attention.

10:09.310 --> 10:11.850
I'm your opponent!

10:13.720 --> 10:14.960
Pram!

10:17.430 --> 10:19.750
Now the nuisance is gone.

10:21.020 --> 10:24.330
Honestly, I didn't expect you 
to survive this long.

10:25.460 --> 10:27.230
But this will be the end...

10:29.090 --> 10:32.170
for you and your party.

10:50.620 --> 10:51.620
Get up.

10:52.010 --> 10:54.320
That wasn't enough 
to take you out, was it?

10:59.430 --> 11:01.060
Stone Break!

11:09.360 --> 11:10.400
Winterfist!

11:20.590 --> 11:21.650
Inversing...

11:29.250 --> 11:30.560
<i>Make it in time!</i>

11:45.760 --> 11:47.960
You gave up on the great sword?

11:48.350 --> 11:51.230
Why don't you swing it 
around like the last time?!

11:52.120 --> 11:54.320
You're chattier than I thought.

11:55.740 --> 11:57.780
The hell?! You...!

11:59.980 --> 12:01.570
How dare you!

12:02.160 --> 12:03.200
There!

12:12.850 --> 12:13.870
Take this!

12:16.340 --> 12:17.470
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

12:17.470 --> 12:18.720
<i>What's going on?!</i>

12:19.830 --> 12:20.890
Damn it!

12:22.550 --> 12:24.560
<i>My skills aren't enough?</i>

12:27.060 --> 12:29.700
<i>He's completely different 
from the last time!</i>

12:33.060 --> 12:34.400
You bastard!

12:38.960 --> 12:41.410
Hey... What's going on?

12:43.570 --> 12:48.520
How did you get so strong 
in such a short time?

12:49.050 --> 12:51.430
I don't owe you an explanation!

12:51.790 --> 12:53.290
Blegh.

12:53.600 --> 12:57.830
Know your place, trash beta!

13:02.800 --> 13:04.920
What the heck is Doneta doing?

13:05.950 --> 13:07.970
Wind Strike!

13:11.550 --> 13:16.020
If I remember correctly, 
you're a mage of Circle 2.

13:17.420 --> 13:21.270
And that's the best you've got?

13:23.730 --> 13:25.280
<i>Crap.</i>

13:25.280 --> 13:27.040
<i>I don't have much mana left.</i>

13:28.170 --> 13:31.720
<i>And I'm at a disadvantage in close combat.</i>

13:31.720 --> 13:33.750
It doesn't matter. Let's end th—

13:34.330 --> 13:35.250
Wh-What?!

13:35.960 --> 13:37.000
Desir!

13:40.020 --> 13:42.040
I've lost visibility.

13:43.000 --> 13:44.940
But so have they.

13:47.720 --> 13:50.290
What are you going to do, Romantica?

13:59.730 --> 14:01.200
How did she know my location?

14:30.670 --> 14:33.490
I see. She used the wind to locate me.

14:34.130 --> 14:35.350
How stupid.

14:37.060 --> 14:39.490
<i>I'll end this while there's still fog.</i>

14:46.540 --> 14:48.420
What?! A magical reaction?

15:02.430 --> 15:04.340
So pathetic!

15:12.850 --> 15:14.060
Is that...

15:22.990 --> 15:24.780
...an artifact?!

15:25.620 --> 15:28.070
Something too good for a commoner.

15:28.470 --> 15:30.210
Commoner this, commoner that!

15:30.210 --> 15:32.410
You and I aren't that different!

15:32.930 --> 15:36.680
Regardless of status, 
you're students just like us!

15:36.680 --> 15:37.710
Just like you?

15:37.710 --> 15:41.310
Yes! You're students 
and humans, just like us!

15:41.310 --> 15:45.170
Try as you might to segregate us, 
that fact won't change.

15:45.170 --> 15:46.790
Just like you?!

15:47.230 --> 15:50.480
I, a noble, am like you, a commoner?

15:51.180 --> 15:55.180
If you think I'm wrong, 
tell me exactly what the difference is!

15:55.180 --> 15:56.680
Everything!

15:58.560 --> 15:59.830
Class!

15:59.830 --> 16:01.130
Strength!

16:01.130 --> 16:02.190
Talent!

16:02.680 --> 16:06.310
We've been different since 
the moment we were born!

16:06.310 --> 16:09.560
A commoner like you needs 
to stop speaking nonsense!

16:11.910 --> 16:14.800
<i>There's no way you and I are the same.</i>

16:16.220 --> 16:17.670
You're crazy.

16:19.530 --> 16:22.210
You wouldn't understand even if I told you.

16:22.840 --> 16:25.070
You can learn it the hard way.

16:29.550 --> 16:30.490
Wind—

16:30.490 --> 16:31.180
Blast.

16:41.450 --> 16:42.700
Romantica!

16:43.190 --> 16:44.710
Are you okay?

16:49.410 --> 16:51.230
I blocked it, just barely.

16:56.240 --> 16:57.450
Percival.

16:57.450 --> 16:58.500
Hm?

16:58.500 --> 16:59.710
I'm going to do it.

17:00.750 --> 17:02.900
I'll slaughter all the commoners.

17:02.900 --> 17:04.460
H-Hey!

17:08.560 --> 17:10.110
Pram, can you take over?

17:10.110 --> 17:12.200
I need to restore my mana.

17:12.200 --> 17:13.360
Understood.

17:28.310 --> 17:29.420
Pram!

17:31.760 --> 17:33.820
You're finished!

17:37.850 --> 17:38.790
Doneta!

17:54.810 --> 17:57.350
You filthy commoners...

17:59.170 --> 18:01.230
Every single one of you!

18:01.230 --> 18:03.770
Hey, Pram is my prey.

18:03.770 --> 18:04.900
Shut up!

18:06.320 --> 18:07.780
I'll kill them!

18:11.470 --> 18:12.870
Are you all right?

18:12.870 --> 18:13.810
Yes.

18:14.370 --> 18:18.410
That tall guy had tunnel vision.

18:18.410 --> 18:21.870
He didn't even try to look around. 
He was so focused on you...

18:23.000 --> 18:25.380
I was able to take advantage of that.

18:26.190 --> 18:27.580
<i>What do I do?</i>

18:27.580 --> 18:30.020
<i>He's not someone I can beat 
without my magic.</i>

18:30.510 --> 18:31.630
<i>But...</i>

18:32.480 --> 18:35.890
<i>In my current condition, 
I'll only slow Pram down.</i>

18:39.200 --> 18:40.390
Pram.

18:41.230 --> 18:44.770
Can you steer spiky-hair 
somewhere else?

18:45.210 --> 18:47.010
I think I can...

18:47.010 --> 18:48.290
But why?

18:48.750 --> 18:51.110
Doneta is after me,

18:51.110 --> 18:52.770
so I'll fight him myself.

18:55.310 --> 18:59.030
You want to take on spiky-hair
 one-on-one, don't you?

18:59.790 --> 19:02.050
It's not a problem, so leave it to me.

19:04.530 --> 19:07.310
That's not what your face says.

19:09.210 --> 19:11.440
You don't want to slow me down...

19:11.990 --> 19:13.900
Isn't that what you're thinking?

19:14.840 --> 19:15.990
It's just...

19:16.510 --> 19:18.300
Then I'll have to refuse.

19:18.300 --> 19:19.650
Pram.

19:21.040 --> 19:23.930
All three of us will become 
single rankers together.

19:24.320 --> 19:26.060
No one is left behind.

19:26.060 --> 19:28.480
That's what a party is for.

19:29.890 --> 19:33.570
Plus, Desir once told us...

19:34.210 --> 19:35.960
Don't you worry!

19:35.960 --> 19:40.080
You two are truly getting strong, 
I guarantee it.

19:41.470 --> 19:43.120
We are strong.

19:44.630 --> 19:45.950
Pram.

19:47.250 --> 19:49.440
Please stop smiling like that.

19:49.440 --> 19:51.590
It's annoying because you look like him.

19:52.000 --> 19:54.460
I love Desir's smile.

19:54.460 --> 19:56.410
Well, it pisses me off!

19:58.600 --> 20:01.210
I'm sorry... Thank you.

20:03.330 --> 20:04.570
Okay, then.

20:04.570 --> 20:06.190
Let's do this!

20:06.190 --> 20:07.190
Yes!

20:11.010 --> 20:12.860
Is that it for your pointless struggle?

20:14.080 --> 20:16.770
There won't be a goal like 
at the entrance ceremony.

20:17.360 --> 20:18.750
Right.

20:18.750 --> 20:21.870
Let's fight to our hearts' content, Azest.

20:51.410 --> 20:53.240
You can inverse this, too?

20:58.500 --> 20:59.980
Wintercrash!

21:28.060 --> 21:29.350
That's incredible.

21:32.230 --> 21:33.800
Fantastic work, Azest.

21:49.960 --> 21:53.080
Not even a scratch on you. Brava.

22:05.800 --> 22:08.550
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:08.550 --> 22:11.260
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:11.260 --> 22:14.870
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:19.350 --> 22:24.760
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

22:24.760 --> 22:29.360
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairytale</i>

22:30.110 --> 22:35.480
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:35.480 --> 22:39.910
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:40.260 --> 22:46.430
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:46.430 --> 22:51.690
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:51.690 --> 22:56.720
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:56.720 --> 23:00.930
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

23:02.440 --> 23:05.210
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

23:05.210 --> 23:07.900
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

23:07.900 --> 23:11.410
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

23:13.280 --> 23:16.120
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

23:16.120 --> 23:18.700
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

23:18.700 --> 23:21.410
<i>Because this time</i>

23:21.410 --> 23:25.540
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:35.560 --> 23:40.060
<b></b>Episode Nine

23:35.560 --> 23:40.060
<b> Showdown</b>

23:36.380 --> 23:38.980
Next episode, "Showdown."
